@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@revision = 0

### Sign in first (Accounts/Http/Account.http → Login Account)

### Get State
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/state

### Save State (revision = the one you loaded; 409 with the current state when it is stale)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/state
Content-Type: application/json
X-LivingDex: 1

{
  "revision": {{revision}},
  "client": "REST client",
  "data": {
    "caught": { "home|normal": ["1", "4", "7"] }
  }
}

### List History State
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/history?take=30

### Restore History State (saves revision 1 again as a new revision)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/history/1/restore
X-LivingDex: 1
